sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Runtime
    participant P as Predictor
    participant C as Preload cache
    participant N as Next endpoint
    R->>P: record(current, next)
    P-->>R: top-1 prediction
    R->>C: warm predicted module closure
    Note over C: background work
    R->>N: next invocation
    C-->>N: module already resident
